//! The `border-top-right-radius` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! rounds the top-right corner of an element by specifying the radius (or the radius of the
//! semi-major and semi-minor axes) of the ellipse defining the curvature of the corner.
//!
//! Initial: 0. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the corresponding dimension of the border box.
